        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "Handle Ollama usage labels case insensitively",
        "body": "## Summary\n- match Ollama quota labels without depending on capitalization\n- keep quota block boundaries case-insensitive as well\n- prevent cosmetic settings-page copy changes from breaking parsing\n\n## Proof\nThe focused fixture uses `SESSION USAGE` and `Weekly Usage`, confirms both quota percentages parse, and confirms the weekly reset timestamp does not leak into the session block. All 10 focused parser tests pass.\n\nNo live account or browser-cookie probe was run: AGENTS.md requires parser fixtures for this behavior unless live provider access is explicitly requested, and this avoids any Keychain prompt.\n\n## Tests\n- `swift test --disable-sandbox --filter OllamaUsageParserTests` (10 passed)\n- changed Swift files: SwiftFormat and SwiftLint strict passed\n- `git diff --check upstream/main...HEAD`\n\n## Commits\n- 3 focused commits: implementation, tests, documentation",
